---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AskBen — Consumer money triage | Spatialytics"
  description="AskBen is a B2C finance app from Spatialytics. You type the bills. Ben ranks what to pay next. No bank login. No lecture."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <a href="/solutions" class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium hover:underline mb-4 inline-block">← All Solutions</a>
        <p class="text-amber-400 font-medium mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">B2C · Consumer product</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
          AskBen is for people, not back offices
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Spatialytics mostly builds maps and tools for places and organizations. AskBen is the consumer line: a personal finance triage app. You enter what you owe. Ben — a colonial Franklin counselor — ranks the next useful move. No bank password. No Social Security number. No twelve-tab lecture.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Who it is for</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Anyone who knows the bills are there and wants one honest next step. Overdue, tight, or just trying to stay organized. Built for real households, including Greater Minnesota, not for CFOs.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> You type the ledger. AskBen does not scrape your bank.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> One next action, not a budget religion.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">•</span> Free to start. Paid plans for deeper forecast and import tools.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">How it is different from our B2B work</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Grant Match, groundwater screens, and HyperLocal Insights serve nonprofits, sites, and operators. AskBen is sold to a person with a phone and a due date.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Product: consumer SaaS at askben.buzz</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Motion: signup → pick Ben’s voice → add one bill → ask what to pay</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Reward: Franklin’s Landing, a 3D town that unlocks after the ledger has a number</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card border-amber-500/20 mb-16">
        <p class="text-amber-400 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Shipped 28 Aug 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What landed today</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">1</span> Full Franklin’s Landing restored: harbor, lanterns, weather, NPCs, GLBs, multiplayer.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">2</span> Street-facing doors, windows, and signs so the colony reads from the road.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">3</span> Town is dessert. Empty ledger cannot walk the streets until one bill or debt exists.</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">4</span> Login and onboarding send people to the ledger, not the 3D world.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">5</span> Empty-ledger Ben says add one number. He does not invent balances.</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-400">6</span> Heavy lightning and stone-house assets no longer preload on phones.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="https://www.askben.buzz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary">Open AskBen →</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/KristineMK72/money-control-saas" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-secondary">Code</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
